  "title": "The Best Canning Salsa",
  "description": "This recipe for canning salsa makes great use of fresh garden tomatoes and bell peppers. Share this big-batch recipe with friends and enjoy all winter!",
  "authors": [
    "cookingmama"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-19T00:03:14-04:00",
